@startuml
title Register Sequence (/api/auth/register)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Guest
boundary "RegisterScreen UI" as RegisterScreen
entity "RegisterRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as RegisterRequestDto
entity "TokenResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as RegisterResponseDto
entity "AuthTokensDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeTokensDto
control "AuthController" as AuthController
control "AuthService" as AuthService
entity "User" as UserEntity
entity "UserAuth" as UserAuthEntity
entity "UserProfile" as UserProfileEntity
entity "UserLearningProfile" as UserLearningProfileEntity
entity "Role" as RoleEntity
entity "OtpVerification" as OtpEntity
entity "RefreshToken" as RefreshTokenEntity
control "BcryptPasswordHasher" as PasswordHasher
control "AuthAccountRepository" as AuthAccountRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over RegisterScreen, MySQL
BE DTOs exist: RegisterRequest and TokenResponse.
FE response DTO exists: AuthTokensDto.
end note
Guest -> RegisterScreen: Access page
Guest -> RegisterScreen: Enter information
Guest -> RegisterScreen: Click Register button
RegisterScreen -> RegisterScreen: Validate input
alt Data input invalid
RegisterScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Data input valid
RegisterScreen -> RegisterRequestDto: Create request data(phone, password, display_name,otp_code, optional profile fields)
RegisterScreen -> AuthController: POST /api/auth/registerRegisterRequest
AuthController -> AuthController: Validate RegisterRequest
alt Request validation fails
AuthController --> RegisterScreen: HTTP 400 with validation errors
RegisterScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Request validation success
AuthController -> AuthService: RegisterAsync(register data)
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: FindByPhoneAsync(phone)
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Query user by phone
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user account
MySQL --> DbContext: User row or null
DbContext -> UserEntity: Materialize User?
DbContext -> UserAuthEntity: Materialize UserAuth?
UserEntity --> DbContext: User or null
UserAuthEntity --> DbContext: UserAuth or null
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: AuthAccount or null
alt Account exists
AuthService --> AuthController: Conflict result
AuthController --> RegisterScreen: HTTP 409 Phone already exists
RegisterScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Phone is available
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: Check latest active OTP
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Query latest active OTP
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT latest OTP
MySQL --> DbContext: OTP row or null
DbContext -> OtpEntity: Materialize OtpVerification?
OtpEntity --> DbContext: OtpVerification or null
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: OTP result
alt OTP invalid
AuthService --> AuthController: Unauthorized/Conflict result
AuthController --> RegisterScreen: HTTP error
RegisterScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else OTP valid
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: FindRoleByNameAsync("User")
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Query role
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Role row or null
DbContext -> RoleEntity: Materialize Role?
RoleEntity --> DbContext: Role or null
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: AuthRole or null
alt Default user role missing
AuthService --> AuthController: Validation failure
AuthController --> RegisterScreen: HTTP 400 error
RegisterScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Role exists
AuthService -> PasswordHasher: Hash(password)
PasswordHasher --> AuthService: password hash
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: StageCreateAsync(CreateAuthAccount)
AuthAccountRepository -> UserEntity: Create User
AuthAccountRepository -> UserAuthEntity: Create UserAuth
AuthAccountRepository -> UserProfileEntity: Create UserProfile
AuthAccountRepository -> UserLearningProfileEntity: Create UserLearningProfile?
UserEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: User
UserAuthEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: UserAuth
UserProfileEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: UserProfile
UserLearningProfileEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: UserLearningProfile?
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Add User, UserAuth,\nUserProfile, UserLearningProfile?
DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT account data
MySQL --> DbContext: Insert result
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Save result
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: FindByPhoneAsync(phone)
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Reload created account
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT created user account
MySQL --> DbContext: Created user row
DbContext -> UserEntity: Materialize created User
DbContext -> UserAuthEntity: Materialize created UserAuth
DbContext -> UserProfileEntity: Materialize created UserProfile
DbContext -> UserLearningProfileEntity: Materialize created UserLearningProfile?
UserEntity --> DbContext: User
UserAuthEntity --> DbContext: UserAuth
UserProfileEntity --> DbContext: UserProfile
UserLearningProfileEntity --> DbContext: UserLearningProfile?
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: Created account
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: Mark OTP used
AuthAccountRepository -> OtpEntity: Set UsedAt
OtpEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: OtpVerification updated
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Track OTP used
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE otp_verifications
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Save result
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: Create refresh token
AuthAccountRepository -> RefreshTokenEntity: Create RefreshToken
RefreshTokenEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: RefreshToken
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Add RefreshToken
DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT refresh_tokens
MySQL --> DbContext: Insert result
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Save result
AuthService --> AuthController: Return register result
AuthController -> RegisterResponseDto: Create response data(access_token, refresh_token,\nexpires_in, token_type)
AuthController -> FeTokensDto: HTTP 201 Created\nTokenResponse JSON
FeTokensDto --> RegisterScreen: AuthTokens
RegisterScreen --> Guest: Show success message
end
end
end
end
end
@enduml
